2.53.0

Add DT overlay for feature connector expansion module eDM-MOD-iMX8Mm-FIO1
providing additional UARTs, CAN, PWM Beeper, I2C, SPI and GPIO breakout.
This adapter can be optionally populated onto the eDM SBC.

