+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
+ * Novatek NT36532 DriverIC panels driver
+ * Based on the template generated by linux-mdss-dsi-panel-driver-generator
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2025, 2026 Junjie Cao <junjie.cao@linux.dev>
